/-- **The Nieuwland number of `Johnson.AugmentedTruncatedCube.polyhedron`, by representatives**: `ν Johnson.AugmentedTruncatedCube.polyhedron` lies in `[k, k + 1] / 10 ^ 30`, and it is the first coordinate of the root of each of finitely many systems of integer polynomial equations, each in a rational box of all its variables and each with exactly one root in its box (`IsPolyRootEq`, `Modules/System/PolyRootEq.lean`); the systems are those of `johnsonAugmentedTruncatedCube_nu_reps_list`. -/
theorem johnsonAugmentedTruncatedCube_nu_reps :
    ν Johnson.AugmentedTruncatedCube.polyhedron ∈ Set.Icc ((1037644403513322559298413992416 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ((1037644403513322559298413992417 : ℝ) / 10 ^ 30) ∧
      IsPolyRootEq (ν Johnson.AugmentedTruncatedCube.polyhedron) :=
  ⟨johnsonAugmentedTruncatedCube_nu.1, PolynomialSystem.isPolyRootEq (by decide +kernel) johnsonAugmentedTruncatedCube_nu_reps_list⟩

